  ["Liana activates the cyclic power of 3-888; both receive significantly reduced damage; prioritize breaking the 3-888 shield!"] = "Liana ativa o poder cíclico de 3-888; ambos recebem danos significativamente reduzidos; priorize quebrar o escudo 3-888!",
