  ["The Hanged Man - Reversed"] = "O Enforcado - Invertido",
  ["Brandon, who had fallen in front of the blackboard, struggled to get up and began to write slowly on the blackboard. \nBrandon: I want to teach you how to read and write, at least, teach you how to write your own names..."] = "Brandon, que havia caído na frente do quadro-negro, lutou para se levantar e começou a escrever lentamente no quadro-negro. \nBrandon: Eu quero te ensinar a ler e escrever, pelo menos, te ensinar a escrever seus próprios nomes...",
