  ["A Tripwire has appeared at the Death Emperor's Demise Plaza <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"loc=8280,1594,3907,2,5200148,0\"> [Star Plateau (182,114)] </>. Pick it up to use the Tripwire skill on knights!"] = "Um Tripwire apareceu no Death Emperor's Demise Plaza <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"loc=8280,1594,3907,2,5200148,0\"> [Star Plateau (182,114)] </> . Pegue-o para usar a habilidade Tripwire em cavaleiros!",
  ["A summoning mechanism has been activated at the Death Emperor's Demise Plaza <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"loc=8280,3794,3907,2,5200148,0\"> [Star Plateau (182,137)] </>. Complete the mechanism to trigger a team summon!"] = "Um mecanismo de convocação foi ativado no Death Emperor's Demise Plaza <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"loc=8280,3794,3907,2,5200148,0\"> [Star Plateau (182,137)] </> . Complete o mecanismo para acionar uma convocação de equipe!",
